{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Sarek_vulkan.Vulkan_api_barrier</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek-vulkan","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Sarek_vulkan","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Vulkan_api_barrier","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Global memory barriers recorded into command buffers. Vulkan orders the start of commands in a queue, not their memory: every producer/consumer pair below needs one. The first scope of a barrier includes every command submitted to the queue before it, so a barrier at the head of a command buffer also orders it after earlier submissions.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-record\"><a href=\"#val-record\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> record : \u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_command_buffer\">Vulkan_types.vk_command_buffer</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes_static</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src_stage</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst_stage</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src_access</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst_access</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compute\"><a href=\"#val-compute\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compute : int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-transfer\"><a href=\"#val-transfer\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> transfer : int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-shader_rw\"><a href=\"#val-shader_rw\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> shader_rw : int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-writes\"><a href=\"#val-writes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> writes : int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-before_dispatch\"><a href=\"#val-before_dispatch\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> before_dispatch : \u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_command_buffer\">Vulkan_types.vk_command_buffer</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes_static</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Before a dispatch: the writes of earlier dispatches and copies are visible to it.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-end_of_batch\"><a href=\"#val-end_of_batch\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> end_of_batch : \u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_command_buffer\">Vulkan_types.vk_command_buffer</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes_static</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>End of a launch batch: dispatch writes are visible to later copies and to the host.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-before_copy\"><a href=\"#val-before_copy\" class=\"anchor\"